{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_041ryo_01_1_2_041_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:7793004770b7bdb304da2a32fb970303a27b3f7de8b59531e3ac3169df312c8f",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_041ryo_01_1_2_041_01:1_2_041_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:426f356f054065acb4df47888b31832fcb2cb1e2a162121c40cbb83c0a3d514e",
      "text": "转祸为福，喜笑颜开",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_041ryo_01_1_2_041_01:1_2_041_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bd912ed7628350105279f05ff45e771875fc8f3c75f902c1e7c2a15d3e27e504",
      "text": "来到男生宿舍的制作人，\n给正在打扫的凉送来了慰问品。\n正要去厨房准备饮料的凉发出了尖叫声。\n赶到凉身边的制作人看到的是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_041ryo_01_1_2_041_01:1_2_041_01_a:cmd-000011:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7824b3a8948acd2c72636875e79b09adab6d8fca3c20b65cfcfd68e8d3eae4ba",
      "text": "第1话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_041ryo_01_1_2_041_01:1_2_041_01_a:cmd-000011:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:426f356f054065acb4df47888b31832fcb2cb1e2a162121c40cbb83c0a3d514e",
      "text": "转祸为福，喜笑颜开",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_041ryo_01_1_2_041_01:1_2_041_01_a:cmd-000020:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0ac08573febdbd905e8eaaa89660c461b15034c891aae9fb5d9a49c4ac858c41",
      "text": "男生宿舍·食堂",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_041ryo_01_1_2_041_01:1_2_041_01_a:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:00cafe815f36c3f19e0005b25cbc2c4d996f15c1b24fbd66096bb6c752d14ec0",
      "text": "这样就搞定啦……呼呼，地板闪闪发亮！\n接下来，打扫一下洗手池周围吧……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_041ryo_01_1_2_041_01:1_2_041_01_a:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3d855556de4479b0a5dd026af4096a6b0079749180b1f830e174979f3a6fdf38",
      "text": "……哎呀？●●●●プロデューサー！\n你好。今天怎么过来了？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_041ryo_01_1_2_041_01:1_2_041_01_a:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:87b62ff7d0ac623c8ddaefbedf12ca70ef0f6e349ebbdce24372386bf39a26ce",
      "text": "凉先生也在这儿啊。这是慰问品。\n如果不嫌弃的话，请和宿舍的大家一起享用吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_041ryo_01_1_2_041_01:1_2_041_01_a:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5b368619c0d7b03ae413cb0c2ed93dea8adafc01b0bacc2af303181a5edfd4f6",
      "text": "哇，有咖啡还有可可。甚至还有点心！\n非常感谢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_041ryo_01_1_2_041_01:1_2_041_01_a:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:783d48e19318c3f57985e9103aaeb8020ebfd24504f215d866955df8295edfcc",
      "text": "不客气。话说回来，凉先生\n也在帮男生宿舍分担家务呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_041ryo_01_1_2_041_01:1_2_041_01_a:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1f07f8b559b90477338c4724cbf8d3480342c4aeb2731f7003663fbb84957685",
      "text": "是的，我经常来这里。\n有空的话就会顺便打扫打扫。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_041ryo_01_1_2_041_01:1_2_041_01_a:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b460067de7a0bffd0ff9782481ad40618d18cf41ffb00c002986cde6f08289a5",
      "text": "啊，对了。\n我这就去泡您送来的可可♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_041ryo_01_1_2_041_01:1_2_041_01_a:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e7e8266a78304c6acc523897738228ba5aeafedf9dbc31f8042cd8b7897ef1e8",
      "text": "非常感谢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_041ryo_01_1_2_041_01:1_2_041_01_a:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f455d93f04b005eacb41d0d22a569b0d38fb7d5b99bf469419cd950aae35e6ad",
      "text": "嘎哦哦哦嗯！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_041ryo_01_1_2_041_01:1_2_041_01_a:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d21afe83f28dab99ba29f179c4987361c24a94381ec1bf54d17135931d9c5656",
      "text": "刚才那是尖叫声！？\n凉先生，怎么了吗！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_041ryo_01_1_2_041_01:1_2_041_01_b:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f5d0c861dcccec92df00123325dfd9ce9bb79c79f8361a4a4c2e8622e6c369f6",
      "text": "凉先生，发生什么事了！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_041ryo_01_1_2_041_01:1_2_041_01_b:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:adf68f46d15df31b3fdc58b5eb837fd7a9d125dc5ad7eee2f22b5fd02ef04780",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー……\n请看看冰箱里面！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_041ryo_01_1_2_041_01:1_2_041_01_b:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7a3c4a6ca1c679be682e65ad6e1f7f4ebd77591d50bea708d0c3adc7a50bddd9",
      "text": "有3瓶还没开封的牛奶，保质期全都是明天！\n所以忍不住吃惊地叫出声了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_041ryo_01_1_2_041_01:1_2_041_01_b:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9590d7fbb51a66bf1cfa13ec1ef24a01194764056349cac8524f82fcd8948333",
      "text": "虽然宿舍里会有很多人来，\n但真担心能不能喝得完啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_041ryo_01_1_2_041_01:1_2_041_01_b:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:51ccd5ff751be5c335b3ade11021f7397704948ab9d66d691b6ea35a449cb08e",
      "text": "好，首先冲可可多用点牛奶消耗一下吧。\n管够续杯哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_041ryo_01_1_2_041_01:1_2_041_01_b:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ca575a348343ad05f4aca11ad0e440d6423d22791f9d6c58fbb632c206914f4b",
      "text": "就算续杯喝了好多可可，\n牛奶还是剩了不少呢……唔。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_041ryo_01_1_2_041_01:1_2_041_01_b:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d8d42c05079fbe8007f420ea03d09cf8341a28269299498b625321d9d66b632f",
      "text": "是啊，大家也还没有露面。\n……要不做点什么东西招待大家怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_041ryo_01_1_2_041_01:1_2_041_01_b:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:25d124a4721a29ca31380626d12c50384d65ab54f74aba914443365208609f34",
      "text": "这个主意好！如果做成牛奶布丁之类的，\n感觉就能全部用完了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_041ryo_01_1_2_041_01:1_2_041_01_b:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8bc26592cc70e86b387f244a5307b2089dfcb466fffceee0e452d6e82342032f",
      "text": "凉先生一个人做那么多会很辛苦吧，\n我也来帮忙。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_041ryo_01_1_2_041_01:1_2_041_01_b:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ec0ec535b7615124e12b6d7ed1eaa56da3ee96cfead2c64c26d94af67c3dc006",
      "text": "谢谢您！为了大家，\n一起来做美味的布丁吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_041ryo_01_1_2_041_01:1_2_041_01_c:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:70f9cb97e230d413d8c0daa8a3dd9324610f0ab0e81023173dd6c3de3c8ae39d",
      "text": "首先把牛奶倒进锅里加热……\n啊，能麻烦您帮忙加一下糖吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_041ryo_01_1_2_041_01:1_2_041_01_c:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a1f59d651ac7f2a161ce41b9bcf827cc38ce938db8949a2a790d6197866549a8",
      "text": "好的。\n……凉先生看起来心情很好呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_041ryo_01_1_2_041_01:1_2_041_01_c:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fa0e12db22ba27b1e88a7f5b6f8155b91a083b62a747c28fc2e838c026bd6f2e",
      "text": "是的！能和●●●●プロデューサー一起\n做料理很开心。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_041ryo_01_1_2_041_01:1_2_041_01_c:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7fbf1867d83bd8dc3181f9b899fdd1030e27f9e715a5088691405e14422fc8cb",
      "text": "哼哼哼哼哼哼哼哼～♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_041ryo_01_1_2_041_01:1_2_041_01_c:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:38ad83c730521a6b4475738e159a482139a1b614cf61ac13c00865834f92b386",
      "text": "能听到凉先生的歌声，\n主动提出帮忙真是太值了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_041ryo_01_1_2_041_01:1_2_041_01_c:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:43a332d7d6bd8070fb5b59e49162ec6ffbae906a0954a1cba2d67a7d0516237f",
      "text": "哎嘿嘿，是吗？\n……那我再稍微唱一点点吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_041ryo_01_1_2_041_01:1_2_041_01_c:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:043364a113e4c82112860d6d0cbdf8fbf6071ac79a8d8ca4ff6a567be93e5091",
      "text": "（凉先生开心的笑容，加上美妙的歌声。\n真是奢侈的时光啊……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_041ryo_01_1_2_041_01:1_2_041_01_c:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:00b9c72d5f710f016335b91795225b8cf8c25ae235d89c404a37c513be38e4b7",
      "text": "……哇，牛奶溢出来了！？\n得赶紧关火……好烫！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_041ryo_01_1_2_041_01:1_2_041_01_c:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7499c8b1d6d05ce8055e1f61351f1c431068ed613bfd3db02103cdab0ec8deeb",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，您没事吧！？\n快用凉水冲一下！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_041ryo_01_1_2_041_01:1_2_041_01_d:cmd-000010:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:94c47e71a7f809652716c93dcac4901345742e2813115851d14db6b4d4bcc329",
      "text": "数分钟后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_041ryo_01_1_2_041_01:1_2_041_01_d:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:584093e6dbeec4a4a9d9e5cade6f054484797ca20364aa5afb4fa7172119ef2f",
      "text": "谢谢你帮我处理伤口。\n已经没事了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_041ryo_01_1_2_041_01:1_2_041_01_d:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7b2a26787e65a38d4d1c1170b64f5f41a39ae5340d61579235ca1324fad810a8",
      "text": "太好了。\n不过，请千万不要勉强自己哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_041ryo_01_1_2_041_01:1_2_041_01_d:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9388fa8f44a9adb2232c07562fc0cfc18810de264bcc896639c31377959859b4",
      "text": "好的。……话说回来，迅速帮我\n处理伤口的凉先生，非常帅气哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_041ryo_01_1_2_041_01:1_2_041_01_d:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bc60d6e10566f432c42e07cfa7d82824b20e6579a9f563badb30b2628aae7be7",
      "text": "真、真的吗！？\n哎嘿嘿……有点害羞呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_041ryo_01_1_2_041_01:1_2_041_01_d:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aba0ce31c870706a15eca465bd527bfa2fa14a3d775dffa6b9005d759e5268d2",
      "text": "危险，●●●●プロデューサー！\n……当时是这种感觉吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_041ryo_01_1_2_041_01:1_2_041_01_d:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f57ef8a65aaaeea103b52b097cf65f0871d56681930f44cab0d0683577d756b6",
      "text": "啊、奇怪？感觉哪里不对？呜呜，好没气势……\n总、总之，我们继续回去做布丁吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_041ryo_01_1_2_041_01:1_2_041_01_d:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5edbfd494199ac64f17c4c72115fdf0c543a57a35d069cb6e86db75e8ae0f225",
      "text": "那个，糖已经放过了对吧。\n那我就尝尝味道……咦？好咸！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_041ryo_01_1_2_041_01:1_2_041_01_d:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c195418fc219f66e6dc06966648cdcccd92b35e4ee43247b91924dc13b26d550",
      "text": "啊、对、对不起！我好像把盐和糖\n给搞混放错了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_041ryo_01_1_2_041_01:1_2_041_01_d:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:26b0589119ab6522d86c72d77f32d8bc3cb5f04a9466cdc0457ce170a4202cc8",
      "text": "刚才开始就一直在给凉先生添麻烦，\n真的很对不起……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_041ryo_01_1_2_041_01:1_2_041_01_d:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:008b8298ca0ad59d55e6c37280ba12b31cd0cd01409aa5d75148ecc9ccd94266",
      "text": "没事的，●●●●プロデューサー。\n我有一个好主意！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_041ryo_01_1_2_041_01:1_2_041_01_d:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7ac17e170bf60dddfe05fc7caecd0ce77d43693a3c1108e3332f82ba60a120ba",
      "text": "好主意……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_041ryo_01_1_2_041_01:1_2_041_01_e:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7d48be8540d947582b45c486e6eec0ce1d5083fc05c3a2ad2976d747e9fa0973",
      "text": "原来如此……\n牛奶锅啊，真是绝妙的想法！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_041ryo_01_1_2_041_01:1_2_041_01_e:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2aa638279ad7dedea0972e3f714fd8b33d79a27f333208792a425beeff2c60d7",
      "text": "还能顺便把冰箱里剩下的蔬菜全用掉，一举两得。\n做成一顿美味的晚餐吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_041ryo_01_1_2_041_01:1_2_041_01_e:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7da8dd24e14ff6611a4607f1f367c6380f109db70c63d8babc888924fe24f4c8",
      "text": "好的！……不过，凉先生。\n布丁没能做成，真的非常抱歉。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_041ryo_01_1_2_041_01:1_2_041_01_e:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3560d02d568fec26e6545e6e5e5bdadfb7f738993f138f2c1882493615ce9e56",
      "text": "请不要介意啦。\n不管是任何人，都是会犯错的嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_041ryo_01_1_2_041_01:1_2_041_01_e:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6871673f0ba2674814d195e739987cb78b365437589f225b047564f946b063ac",
      "text": "我在工作的时候，\n偶尔也会搞砸呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_041ryo_01_1_2_041_01:1_2_041_01_e:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1d78cf0e273284664ca2e7647bd9b573a7bd4b268430e113b78539c68c9fdaaf",
      "text": "但我觉得无论何时都不要垂头丧气，\n积极向前看才是最好的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_041ryo_01_1_2_041_01:1_2_041_01_e:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:140b4ff4ab48b192913476e561f96f58ec6a520dd67860aa9511dfa6e31c0dd3",
      "text": "因为最重要的不是做出牛奶布丁，\n而是让大家开开心心地吃到美味的食物嘛！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_041ryo_01_1_2_041_01:1_2_041_01_e:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:249c83c9dba1ce682e333690710c2ee1bbfa60bff9c5ab88f39cc1690926e45e",
      "text": "凉先生……谢谢你！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_041ryo_01_1_2_041_01:1_2_041_01_e:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:148983aa94f80033219501dbc650f47e4d545295e21ffd07ef56dc2274fbe8aa",
      "text": "哎嘿嘿。啊，牛奶锅做好了哦。\n●●●●プロデューサー，请尝尝味道♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_041ryo_01_1_2_041_01:1_2_041_01_e:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3706b3d5f0e7559364572d408064cefeaabbe70b1997d1bda0fe926d9541ec69",
      "text": "那么，我开动了。\n……嗯，真好吃！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_041ryo_01_1_2_041_01:1_2_041_01_e:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:51e0e766ad3cb92d2c8c6e6f102f55316d101b4d7c25b22dafdbd32038cea23c",
      "text": "（这锅料理的话，大家也一定会喜欢的。\n果然凉先生真厉害啊！）",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
